    "summary": "In this post, you will learn how Inscribe developed an agentic AI system using Amazon Bedrock that reasons across documents the way an expert fraud analyst would. With this new agentic AI system, Inscribe now detects tampered, fabricated, and AI-generated financial documents in under 90 seconds. This is a 20x improvement over traditional manual review, while maintaining the accuracy and explainability required by financial services regulations.",
